{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21700","headline":"酬乐天叹穷愁见寄 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天叹穷愁见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病煎愁绪转纷纷，百里何由说向君。\n老去心情随日减，远来书信隔年闻。\n三冬有电连春雨，九月无霜尽火云。\n并与巴南终岁热，四时谁道各平分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}